{
  "name": "us-tax-mcp",
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "description": "Zero-dependency MCP server that computes US federal and state tax \u2014 federal income tax, self-employment tax, FICA, capital gains, NIIT, the child tax credit and EITC, Section 199A, the SALT cap, quarterly estimated payments and Publication 15-T paycheck withholding for 2024-2026, plus state income tax for 23 states including New York, whose supplemental tax recaptures the lower brackets so a high earner pays their top rate on their whole income. Compares a household across tax years, reports the true marginal rate including credit phase-outs and state cliffs, tells an employee what to put on Form W-4 Step 4(c), and cites the IRS release or state statute behind every figure.",
